<title>USA: Cardinal Health files $350 mln debt shelf.</title>
<headline>Cardinal Health files $350 mln debt shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cardinal Health Inc filed Thursday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration to sell up to $350 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>When combined with a previous registration, Cardinal Health will have a total offering of $400 million in debt securities available for sale.</p>
<p>The company said it has no specific plans for the set proceeds other than general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Cardinal Heath, based in Dublin, Ohio, is a health care provider.</p>
